      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hi, I'm working on my sociology thesis and I'm a bit stuck on the results section. I have a dataset where my p-value for the primary hypothesis is 0.042, and the 95% confidence interval for the effect size is [0.15, 0.85]. Could you explain how I should interpret these two specific values together in a formal way for my paper?",
