      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, thank you. I'm just a little worried about the \"noise\" in my data though. Sometimes it feels like the outliers and the random error are just making everything look less stable than it actually is. How should I address the concept of random error or statistical noise in my discussion section so it doesn't undermine my confidence in the results?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
